  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Fiscal Sustainability and Growth</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Sostenibilidad Fiscal y el Crecimiento</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa consiste en apoyar la recuperacin de la sostenibilidad macroeconmica de Argentina. Los objetivos especficos de desarrollo son: (i) fortalecer las finanzas pblicas; y (ii) fortalecer la balanza de pagos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the program is to support the recovery of Argentina&apos;s macroeconomic sustainability. The specific development objectives are: (i) strengthen public finances; and (ii) strengthen the balance of payments.</narrative>
  </description>
